  "cmd_full_name": "cs list-tag-resources",
  "cmd_name": "list-tag-resources",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "You can add tag key-value pairs to clusters so that cluster developers or O&M engineers can classify and manage clusters more flexibly, and better support requirements such as monitoring, cost analysis, and multi-tenant data isolation. You can call the ListTagResources operation to obtain a list of resource tags and query detailed tag information, such as key-value pairs and associated clusters",
  "description_zh": "您可以为集群添加标签键值对，让集群开发或运维人员能够更灵活地对集群进行分类管理，更好的支持监控、成本分析、租户隔离等需求。您可以调用ListTagResources接口，获取资源标签的列表并查询标签的详细信息，例如键值对、绑定的集群等",
  "kebab_example": "aliyun cs list-tag-resources --resource-ids c71cf3d796c374bf48644482cb0c30000 --resource-type CLUSTER --biz-region-id cn-beijing --tags example-string --next-token 000 --region cn-hangzhou",
